      "string_id": "escape_trader_repair_6",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Now... I'll have this done in the blink of an eye...\\nThere, I'm finished with it, here you are!",
      "JA_current": "Now... I'll have this done in the blink of an eye...\\nThere, I'm finished with it, here you are!",
