      "JA_current": "Hm. Excellent work! Where did you learn these things? Ah, I get it, a magician never reveals his tricks, huh? Well, ok, I understand.",
      "JA_new": "ふむ、見事な腕だ！どこで覚えた？ああ、なるほど。手品師は種を明かさないってわけか？まあいい、分かったよ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": []
    },
